## （二）安装工具

### 1. 安装 Rust

curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- -y
source ~/.cargo/env
rustup update

### 2. 锁定工具链

rustup toolchain install nightly-2025-02-18
rustup component add rust-src llvm-tools-preview --toolchain nightly-2025-02-18
rustup target add riscv64gc-unknown-none-elf --toolchain nightly-2025-02-18
cargo +nightly-2025-02-18 install cargo-binutils --vers "=0.3.3" --locked

### 3. 配置 rsproxy 镜像

mkdir -p ~/.cargo
cat > ~/.cargo/config.toml << 'EOF'
[source.crates-io]
replace-with = 'rsproxy-sparse'

[source.rsproxy-sparse]
registry = "sparse+https://rsproxy.cn/index/"

[net]
retry = 3
EOF

### 4. 装 QEMU 与交叉编译（覆盖现有，无害）

sudo apt update
sudo apt install -y qemu-system-misc gcc-riscv64-unknown-elf

显示 -bash: /home/riscfriedy/.cargo/env：No such file or directory(上一轮已经把 ~/.cargo 目录彻底删干净了，所以脚本里执行的 source ~/.cargo/env 找不到文件。这正好证明旧环境已清空，当前处于纯净状态。)

